bib:'Joshua takes Lachish. King Amaziah is killed here. Sennacherib besieges it and sends his officials from there to Jerusalem, and Jeremiah mentions it among the last cities holding out against Babylon.',
civ:[['Canaanite city',-1800,-1150],['Judahite fortress city',-1000,-586],['Persian',-539,-332]],
vis:'The Judahite city gate and palace-fort platform, the Assyrian siege ramp and the Judahite counter-ramp.',
v:[['Joshua 10:31-32','Joshua takes Lachish.'],['2 Kings 14:19','Amaziah flees to Lachish and is killed.'],['2 Kings 18:14','Hezekiah sends word to the king of Assyria at Lachish.'],['2 Chronicles 32:9','Sennacherib, at Lachish, sends servants to Jerusalem.'],['Jeremiah 34:7','Lachish and Azekah are the last fortified cities of Judah left.'],['Micah 1:13','Micah addresses the inhabitants of Lachish.']],
