vis:'The excavated Samaritan sacred precinct, the Byzantine church of Mary Theotokos, and the modern Samaritan village of Kiryat Luza.',
v:[['Deuteronomy 11:29','Set the blessing on Mount Gerizim.'],['Joshua 8:33','Half the people stand in front of Mount Gerizim.'],['Judges 9:7','Jotham speaks from the top of Mount Gerizim.'],['John 4:20','"Our fathers worshipped in this mountain."']],
