bib:'Lydia is converted by the river, Paul and Silas are beaten and jailed, and the jailer is converted. Paul later writes Philippians to the church.',
civ:[['Macedonian',-356,-168],['Roman colony',-42,395],['Byzantine',395,800]],
vis:'The forum, the Via Egnatia, the theatre, Basilicas A and B, and a crypt traditionally called "Paul\'s prison".',
